                    "author": "What If World",
                    "category": "stories",
                    "description": "Dive into the wildest, wackiest, and most wonderful episodes from the hit kids’ podcast What If World! Featuring talking cats, robot llamas, and monsters galore, each episode answers a real kid’s “what if?” question with creativity and kindness. Perfect for curious kids and playful parents alike. This best-of collection is ad-free and edited especially for Yoto!  \n\nFeatures 15 episodes, including:\nWhat if paper airplanes stayed in the air forever?, What if when you took your hat off it was full of spiders? , What if a cat and a dog started a cooking show? …and more!  \n\nWritten & Performed by Eric O’Keeffe Artwork by Ana Stretcu.",
